To configure your local operating system layer to trigger the ledger backup utility script automatically every hour, open your system crontab configuration profile inside your workspace shell shell console:
bash
crontab -e

Append the line below at the bottom of the configuration file to orchestrate the scheduling loop bounds safely:
text
0 * * * * /bin/bash /absolute/path/to/your/workspace/backup_ledger.sh

Run Diagnostics and Testing

Execute the complete verification testing matrix through your local terminal viewport interface:
bash
pytest test_sentience_core.py -v
